Peter,

I&rsquo;d like to take a break from the regular messages you&rsquo;ve been getting to remind you why I&rsquo;m in this race for Congress. Once you finish reading, I hope you will consider supporting me in this fight.

I am a husband and father of five children who has spent much of my life in law enforcement in Illinois &ndash; serving as a prosecutor, private attorney, and judge.

https://click.email.judgejoeforcongress.com/?qs=b7bac579c909c391b74ab3fd980e8334402cfc231320a6295b085e275660f8c52a9c6fdf533029e9eabc89f45491efaff0120f427bcc7b773ad22b2d94bd17ec

My father was an Army combat veteran and my mother served as a US Marine. Together they owned a horseshoe manufacturing business and taught me how to work hard, love my country, and earn a living. Growing up forging horseshoes, I also learned what it means to sweat for a paycheck and finish the work week with calluses on my hands.

When it comes to fighting crime, no one is better suited for the job than me. After completing my undergraduate degree from the University of Illinois in Champaign and graduating from the Northern Illinois University College of Law, I served 20 years as Presiding Judge of the Criminal Division.

After I stepped down from the bench to run for Congress because I wanted to continue my service in a different way. I&rsquo;ve seen the destruction soft-on-crime and radial liberal policies have had on our district. I know the hardworking people of IL-17 deserve better, and I know we CAN do better.

https://click.email.judgejoeforcongress.com/?qs=b7bac579c909c391672b203fd3d4e218747529ba8de890a863aa10d7d5474c8b9be4f6087d53e6c49d444f71c582ad8521826785948c1ee9cf0281a83469b11f
But with time running out until the final votes are cast in this race, I am asking for your help today.

https://click.email.judgejoeforcongress.com/?qs=b7bac579c909c391672b203fd3d4e218747529ba8de890a863aa10d7d5474c8b9be4f6087d53e6c49d444f71c582ad8521826785948c1ee9cf0281a83469b11f
DONATE NOW

My race will come down to every last vote. I&rsquo;m pounding the pavement and doing everything I can to reach every voter before it&rsquo;s too late.

https://click.email.judgejoeforcongress.com/?qs=b7bac579c909c391672b203fd3d4e218747529ba8de890a863aa10d7d5474c8b9be4f6087d53e6c49d444f71c582ad8521826785948c1ee9cf0281a83469b11f
